        "status": "draft",
        "text": "The front matter of WHO's 2022 guidelines on long-acting injectable cabotegravir for HIV prevention, with ISBNs, the CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 IGO licence, suggested citation and disclaimers. It also includes the table of contents and a list of web annexes with links, such as the systematic reviews, modelling, provider survey and evidence-to-decision table.",
